>>
Rule 1 (images must be 2-D or higher rank)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 2
>>
Rule 2 (last dimension must be 3 channels to match the RGB→YUV matrix)
{v_1 : tensor} |= shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1) = 3
>>
Rule 3 (images dtype must be float16/float32/float64 or uint8; disallow bool/complex/other ints)
{v_1 : tensor} |= (6 ≤ dtype_(v_1) ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≤ 8) ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 5
>>
Rule 4 (if images is floating-point, pixel values should be in [0, 1])
{v_1 : tensor} |= if 6 ≤ dtype_(v_1) ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≤ 8 then (0 ≤ min(v_1) ∧ max(v_1) ≤ 1)
